{"seq":3,"slug":"bridge-error-timeout-compat","title":"桥接异常、超时重试与跨版本协议兼容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-webview-native-bridge-hybrid-engineering/jsbridge-protocol-serialization/bridge-error-timeout-compat","wordCount":2463,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"桥接异常-超时重试与跨版本协议兼容\">桥接异常、超时重试与跨版本协议兼容</h1><p>桥接调用失败时，Web 层看到的往往只是一个永远不 resolve 的 Promise。这类静默失败在生产环境里最难定位：支付页在 <code>pay()</code> 之后白屏、扫码组件在低版本 WebView 上回退到空实现、原生方法抛出的 <code>DataCloneError</code> 被容器无声吞掉。跨境混合应用的调用方（前端）与实现方（原生）来自不同团队、发布节奏不同、容器版本在用户设备上横跨数年，因此「失败如何被看见、超时如何收敛、新旧协议如何共存」无法靠单测覆盖，只能靠协议设计预防。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-桥接失败的三层模型\">核心概念：桥接失败的三层模型</h2><p>桥接的每一次调用都要穿过三层边界，每层有各自的失败模式。<strong>传输层</strong>关心消息有没有到达对端（导航被丢弃、<code>postMessage</code> 抛异常）；<strong>语义层</strong>关心对方有没有听懂（协议版本不匹配、方法名不存在、参数超出可序列化范围）；<strong>执行层</strong>关心原生处理逻辑本身是否成功（权限被拒、依赖服务超时）。三层不能混为一谈，因为恢复策略完全不同：传输层可重试，语义层必须降级，执行层要看幂等性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[JS 发起 bridge.invoke] --&gt; B{传输层&lt;br/&gt;消息是否到达原生}&#10;    B --&gt;|超时未达 / 抛异常| B1[传输失败&lt;br/&gt;可安全重试]&#10;    B --&gt;|到达| C{语义层&lt;br/&gt;协议是否匹配}&#10;    C --&gt;|版本不识别 / 方法不存在| C1[不兼容&lt;br/&gt;降级到旧通道]&#10;    C --&gt;|匹配| D{执行层&lt;br/&gt;原生处理结果}&#10;    D --&gt;|成功| E[resolve 回传 payload]&#10;    D --&gt;|可重试错误| D1[退避后重试&lt;br/&gt;需幂等键]&#10;    D --&gt;|不可重试| D2[reject 带错误码&lt;br/&gt;交前端决策]&#10;    B1 --&gt; F[统一失败事件上报&lt;br/&gt;含 traceId]&#10;    C1 --&gt; F&#10;    D1 --&gt; F&#10;    D2 --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[JS 发起 bridge.invoke] --&gt; B{传输层&lt;br/&gt;消息是否到达原生}\n    B --&gt;|超时未达 / 抛异常| B1[传输失败&lt;br/&gt;可安全重试]\n    B --&gt;|到达| C{语义层&lt;br/&gt;协议是否匹配}\n    C --&gt;|版本不识别 / 方法不存在| C1[不兼容&lt;br/&gt;降级到旧通道]\n    C --&gt;|匹配| D{执行层&lt;br/&gt;原生处理结果}\n    D --&gt;|成功| E[resolve 回传 payload]\n    D --&gt;|可重试错误| D1[退避后重试&lt;br/&gt;需幂等键]\n    D --&gt;|不可重试| D2[reject 带错误码&lt;br/&gt;交前端决策]\n    B1 --&gt; F[统一失败事件上报&lt;br/&gt;含 traceId]\n    C1 --&gt; F\n    D1 --&gt; F\n    D2 --&gt; F</pre><p>三层失败的判定依据是<strong>错误码域</strong>：把错误码按 <code>E_TRANSPORT_*</code> / <code>E_PROTOCOL_*</code> / <code>E_EXEC_*</code> 三段编码。React Native 新架构与主流自研容器都把超时归入传输域、方法缺失归入协议域，避免前端把所有失败都当成「网络不好」重试一次了事。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败层</th>\n<th>典型触发</th>\n<th>对端可达性</th>\n<th>推荐恢复</th>\n<th>是否可重试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>导航被误放行、<code>postMessage</code> 抛异常、回调注入丢失</td>\n<td>未知</td>\n<td>短超时 + 有限退避重试</td>\n<td>是（需去重）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义层</td>\n<td>协议版本不识别、方法名不存在、载荷超类型上限</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>降级到旧通道或旧签名</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行层</td>\n<td>权限被拒、原生服务超时、业务校验失败</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>由前端按错误码决策</td>\n<td>视幂等性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（三层划分与错误域编码参照 React Native 新架构 JSI 错误传播说明与 <code>androidx.webkit</code> 的 <code>WebViewFeatureUnsupportedException</code> 语义。）</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时预算与退避重试\">超时预算与退避重试</h2><p>桥接调用不能无限等待。JS 侧的 <code>Promise</code> 一旦没有 <code>reject</code> 路径，前端就退化成永久挂起——用户看到的是加载动画永远转下去。工程上给每次 <code>invoke</code> 一个显式超时预算，超时后向调用方 <code>reject</code>，<strong>同时把请求移入待确认集合</strong>：超时不等于没发生，原生可能已经在处理，只是回传丢失。</p>\n<p>超时预算按负载类型分层设定。以跨境混合应用的三类典型负载为例：高频的 UI 查询（如获取登录态）预算设 500ms 级；支付回调这类强一致调用设 3–5s（覆盖原生侧二次校验）；相机、扫码、大文件下载这类用户可感知的长任务设 10s 以上，或改用「发起 + 事件推送」而非「一发一收」。设单次尝试超时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、重试上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max} = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} t_i,\\qquad t_i = t_0 \\cdot b^{i-1} + j_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.958em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是首次超时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是退避倍数（实践取 2），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是抖动项。抖动不可省略：跨境应用的容器在同一时刻可能对同一后端发起大量桥接调用，若退避严格对齐，重试会退化成同步冲击。标准做法是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j_i \\sim U(0, t_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>重试有一个前置条件常被忽略：<strong>幂等键</strong>。对支付、下单、扣库存这类有副作用的原生调用，重试前必须携带调用方生成的 <code>idempotencyKey</code>，由原生侧去重。没有幂等键的重试是把「重复提交」从传输层搬到了业务层——而且更难复现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function invokeWithRetry(bridge, action, params, opts = {}) {&#10;  const { maxRetries = 2, base = 300, timeout = 3000 } = opts;&#10;  const key = opts.key ?? crypto.randomUUID();&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt;= maxRetries; i++) {&#10;    const t = Math.min(base * 2 ** i + Math.random() * base, timeout);&#10;    try {&#10;      return await bridge.invoke(action, { ...params, idempotencyKey: key }, { timeout: t });&#10;    } catch (err) {&#10;      if (err.domain !== &#39;TRANSPORT&#39;) throw err; // 语义/执行层失败不重试&#10;      bridge.trackPending(key, action); // 超时可能已执行，留痕待对账&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> invokeWithRetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bridge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">maxRetries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opts;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opts.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">randomUUID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRetries; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base, timeout);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bridge.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(action, { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">params, idempotencyKey: key }, { timeout: t });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err.domain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TRANSPORT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 语义/执行层失败不重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      bridge.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trackPending</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, action); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 超时可能已执行，留痕待对账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>err.domain !== &#39;TRANSPORT&#39;</code> 这一行：只有传输域失败才进入重试循环。若一个 <code>E_PROTOCOL_METHOD_NOT_FOUND</code> 被当成可重试错误，代码会重试三次后仍然失败，白白拖长用户的等待时间，还掩盖了真正的问题——协议不兼容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"载荷边界与序列化错误\">载荷边界与序列化错误</h2><p>第二层失败的多数来源是载荷本身不可跨越边界。桥接通道的类型能力受限于各自的序列化算法，而非「JS 对象能装什么」。iOS 的 <code>WKScriptMessageHandler</code> 只能携带可被 WebKit 安全桥接的类型，函数、<code>Symbol</code>、DOM 节点、<code>Error</code> 对象都会在边界被丢弃或抛错；Android 的 <code>WebMessageCompat</code> 在 <code>WEB_MESSAGE_ARRAY_BUFFER</code> 支持二进制之前只能传字符串，JSON 化后的 <code>BigInt</code>、<code>Date</code>、<code>Map</code>、<code>Set</code> 都会退化或直接抛 <code>DataCloneError</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>载荷类型</th>\n<th>JSON 桥接</th>\n<th><code>postMessage</code> / 结构化克隆</th>\n<th>处理建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通对象/数组</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数/闭包</td>\n<td>静默丢弃</td>\n<td>抛 <code>DataCloneError</code></td>\n<td>传方法名，不传函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Date</code></td>\n<td>退化为字符串</td>\n<td>保留为 <code>Date</code></td>\n<td>显式约定为毫秒时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Map</code> / <code>Set</code></td>\n<td>退化为 <code>{}</code> / <code>[]</code></td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>桥接前转数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BigInt</code></td>\n<td>抛错</td>\n<td>保留（新引擎）</td>\n<td>转字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Error</code> 对象</td>\n<td>丢字段</td>\n<td>丢 stack</td>\n<td>只传 <code>{code, message}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环引用</td>\n<td>抛错</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>序列化前剥离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ArrayBuffer</code></td>\n<td>需转 base64</td>\n<td>支持（Android 需 M80+）</td>\n<td>大块二进制走独立通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（类型能力依据 HTML 结构化克隆算法与 <code>androidx.webkit</code> 的 <code>WEB_MESSAGE_ARRAY_BUFFER</code> 特性门控，见文末来源。）</p>\n<p>这张表的工程含义是：<strong>桥接层必须有一个显式的契约校验环节</strong>，在序列化之前拦住不可跨越边界的载荷。校验至少做三件事：类型白名单（拒绝函数、DOM 节点、<code>Symbol</code>、<code>BigInt</code>）、体积上限、循环引用检测。体积上限尤其重要——URL Scheme 通道受导航 URL 长度限制，历史版本 iOS 上限约 2KB、Android 各厂商不一（常见 8KB 量级），超长载荷应改走 <code>postMessage</code> 或分片通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨版本协议兼容与能力协商\">跨版本协议兼容与能力协商</h2><p>混合应用的原生容器与前端资源发布独立，用户设备上可能存在跨越多年的容器版本。<strong>不能用「容器版本号比大小」来判定能力</strong>：Android 的 WebView 由系统外的独立 APK 更新，同一台设备上 Android 版本高并不代表 WebView 功能新；iOS 的 <code>WKWebView</code> 随系统升级，但 <code>WKScriptMessageHandler</code> 的行为在不同 iOS 大版本间也有调整。正确做法是<strong>能力协商</strong>：前端初始化时读取原生声明的能力集，再选择通道与签名。Android 官方推荐用 <code>WebViewFeature.isFeatureSupported()</code> 做运行时门控（调用不受支持的 API 会抛 <code>WebViewFeatureUnsupportedException</code>），诊断时读 <code>WebViewCompat.getCurrentWebViewPackage()</code> 拿实际 WebView 包版本。这套「先问后调」的模式可泛化到自研桥接。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[前端加载完成] --&gt; B[bridge.getCapabilities]&#10;    B --&gt; C{原生是否响应}&#10;    C --&gt;|无响应 / 超时| D[降级 legacy 协议&lt;br/&gt;只用 URL Scheme 最小集]&#10;    C --&gt;|响应| E{协议版本协商}&#10;    E --&gt;|v2| F[结构化消息 + 二进制通道]&#10;    E --&gt;|仅 v1| G[JSON 字符串通道&lt;br/&gt;关闭大载荷]&#10;    F --&gt; H[注册能力变更监听]&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[前端加载完成] --&gt; B[bridge.getCapabilities]\n    B --&gt; C{原生是否响应}\n    C --&gt;|无响应 / 超时| D[降级 legacy 协议&lt;br/&gt;只用 URL Scheme 最小集]\n    C --&gt;|响应| E{协议版本协商}\n    E --&gt;|v2| F[结构化消息 + 二进制通道]\n    E --&gt;|仅 v1| G[JSON 字符串通道&lt;br/&gt;关闭大载荷]\n    F --&gt; H[注册能力变更监听]\n    G --&gt; H</pre><p>协议版本号应放在<strong>每一次调用</strong>而不是只在初始化时协商，因为容器可能在运行时被热更新替换。可落地的策略是「宽进严出」：<strong>入参</strong>上原生接受新旧字段并存，<strong>出参</strong>上前端只读自己需要的字段、忽略未知字段。这样新前端配旧原生、旧前端配新原生都不会崩。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兼容场景</th>\n<th>新前端 + 旧原生</th>\n<th>旧前端 + 新原生</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方法签名</td>\n<td>探测能力，缺失则用旧签名</td>\n<td>原生保留旧签名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增字段</td>\n<td>读到 <code>undefined</code> 走默认</td>\n<td>忽略未知入参</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段改名</td>\n<td>双向映射（读新写旧）</td>\n<td>同时接受新旧名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力删除</td>\n<td>降级到替代实现</td>\n<td>保留 deprecated 别名一版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性与失败对账\">可观测性与失败对账</h2><p>三层失败如果只在前端打一条 <code>console.error</code>，线上问题就只能靠用户截图。桥接失败必须带<strong>可关联的 traceId</strong>，把 JS 侧的发起、原生的接收、原生的处理结果串成一条链，两端可对账。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还多一层要求：<strong>网络与合规双重不确定性</strong>。用户可能在弱网、跨境漫游或被目标平台网络策略影响，延迟分布远比纯原生应用宽。因此监控要看<strong>分层失败率</strong>——传输层失败率高通常指向容器或网络，语义层失败率高指向版本发版不一致，执行层失败率高才是真正的业务问题。</p>\n<p>待确认集合需要对账生命周期：超时后进入待确认，前端在下一个稳定时机（页面重新可见、网络恢复）主动查询这批 id 在原生侧的真实结果，把「超时但实际成功」与「超时且未执行」分开。不做这一步，超时重试就会制造重复副作用——这正是强调幂等键的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>桥接失败分三层：传输层（可达性）、语义层（协议匹配）、执行层（业务结果），错误码必须按域编码。</li>\n<li>只有传输层失败可安全重试；重试须配抖动指数退避与幂等键，超时请求移入待确认集合做异步对账。</li>\n<li>载荷能力受序列化算法约束而非 JS 对象能力：函数、DOM 节点、<code>BigInt</code>、循环引用都会在边界出问题，桥接前需显式校验类型、体积与循环。</li>\n<li>跨版本兼容靠能力协商而非版本号比较：Android 的 WebView 独立更新，应使用运行时门控而非 <code>SDK_INT</code>。</li>\n<li>协议演进坚持「入参宽松、出参严格」：新增字段可并存、改名做双向映射、删除能力保留别名一版。</li>\n<li>失败可观测性要求分层监控与 traceId 贯穿，跨境弱网下必须能区分「传输抖动」与「版本不一致」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"来源\">来源</h2><ul>\n<li>Android Developers — <code>WebViewCompat</code> 与 <code>WebViewFeature</code> 运行时门控：<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/webkit/WebViewCompat\">https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/webkit/WebViewCompat</a></li>\n<li>Android Developers — <code>WEB_MESSAGE_ARRAY_BUFFER</code> 二进制载荷（<code>androidx.webkit</code> 1.4.0，需 WebView M80+）：<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/webkit/WebViewFeature\">https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/webkit/WebViewFeature</a></li>\n<li>Apple Developer — <code>WKScriptMessageHandler</code> 与 <code>WKUserContentController</code>：<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/webkit/wkscriptmessagehandler\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/webkit/wkscriptmessagehandler</a></li>\n<li>MDN — 结构化克隆算法与 <code>DataCloneError</code>：<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API/Structured_clone_algorithm\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API/Structured_clone_algorithm</a></li>\n<li>Meta / React Native — 新架构 JSI 与跨语言错误传播：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/react-native/wiki/New-Architecture\">https://github.com/facebook/react-native/wiki/New-Architecture</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>延伸阅读（同 hub 内）：<a href=\"jsbridge-communication-models\">JSBridge 通信模型对比</a> · <a href=\"bridge-serialization-correlation\">桥接序列化与回调关联</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"桥接异常、超时重试与跨版本协议兼容","id":"桥接异常-超时重试与跨版本协议兼容"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：桥接失败的三层模型","id":"核心概念-桥接失败的三层模型"},{"level":2,"text":"超时预算与退避重试","id":"超时预算与退避重试"},{"level":2,"text":"载荷边界与序列化错误","id":"载荷边界与序列化错误"},{"level":2,"text":"跨版本协议兼容与能力协商","id":"跨版本协议兼容与能力协商"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性与失败对账","id":"可观测性与失败对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"来源","id":"来源"}],"prev":{"title":"桥接消息序列化、请求响应关联与回调管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-webview-native-bridge-hybrid-engineering/jsbridge-protocol-serialization/bridge-serialization-correlation"},"next":{"title":"原生能力路由与插件注册中心模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-webview-native-bridge-hybrid-engineering/native-capability-routing-security/capability-router-registry-model"}}